#: ../../user/plugin-os.md:117
msgid "Async getters"
msgstr "Async ゲッター"

#: ../../user/plugin-os.md:119
msgid ""
"The remaining two functions are async because they pull values from the "
"OS at call time rather than at plugin init. They go through the regular "
"Tauri IPC (`plugin:os|locale` and `plugin:os|hostname`) and return "
"`promise<Nullable.t<string>>` — `Nullable.null` means the OS did not "
"expose the value."
msgstr ""

